2139:The task is the canonical repeated-division conversion. The supplied semantics directly supports every operation it needs (`while`, `%`, `//`, `str(int)`, and string concatenation), so I’m using the compact accumulator implementation. The proof target will cover all nonnegative inputs and bases 2–9, with zero matching the prompt-compatible empty-string behavior of this loop.
