2224:A recursive formulation is better suited to this semantics’ symbolic engine while remaining the same algorithm: it exposes the mathematical recurrence directly, so the end-to-end function-call claim can use K’s circularity rule on the recursive call. I’m switching to that form before building the harness; concrete behavior remains identical on the intended domain.
