The label filter also appears to remove the helper claim from the proof theory, producing the same unbounded-recursion diagnostic. The authoritative reconstruction remains the original two-claim run plus the helper’s isolated run; I’m terminating this filter experiment if it does not resolve immediately and will document why isolated closure of the dependent target is not a valid expectation.
